void setup() {
  Serial.begin(9600); // Initialize UART communication at 9600 baud
  Serial.println("--- Monster Lab Station Online ---");
}

void loop() {
  Serial.print("Heartbeat timestamp: ");
  Serial.println(millis()); // Print milliseconds since boot
  delay(1000);              // Wait 1 second before repeating
}
```

Open **Tools > Serial Monitor** and set the bottom-right dropdown to **9600 baud** to view real-time diagnostics.
